WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,670
don't look at me

2
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:01,960
This is what Mr. Lu ordered

3
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,800
Say what you handled last time was very good

4
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,360
Sometimes we might leave first

5
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,560
Your salary is calculated daily

6
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,320
If you can't find us by then, we may be anxious.

7
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,560
So this time I will give you the money first to thank Mr. Lu.

8
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,400
Thank you, Brother Chen. You're welcome.

9
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,640
Then just watch from here

10
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,240
If you can't handle anything, you can come to me.

11
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:23,510
This doesn't matter

12
00:00:23,510 --> 00:00:28,820
Find a place to rest. Brother, something happened again over there.

13
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:29,940
Hurry up and take a look

14
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:30,980
What happened again?

15
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:32,380
You'll know if you go over and take a look

16
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:38,880
Isn’t this Dr. Zhu’s father Zhu Ziran?

17
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,560
I even had a meal with him.

18
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,420
You bad old man

19
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,740
I didn't. Don't talk nonsense.

20
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:44,940
Why am I harassing you?

21
00:00:44,940 --> 00:00:46,100
Am I this kind of person?

22
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,220
How old am I?

23
00:00:47,220 --> 00:00:49,060
Who knows how old you are?

24
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:50,980
You're still here at such an old age?

25
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:54,820
Who knows what's going on in your mind?
